      "release": {
        "tag": "v2.12.0",
        "published_at": "2026-10-08T22:30:26Z",
        "url": "https://github.com/AgoraIO/agora-agents-go/releases/tag/v2.12.0",
        "notes": "### Added\n\n- **Tavus, Protoface, and LemonSlice avatar aliases** — AgentKit now exports `Tavus`, `Protoface`, `TavusOptions`, `ProtofaceOptions`, `NewTavus`, `NewProtoface`, `LemonSlice`, `LemonSliceOptions`, and `NewLemonSlice` from `agentkit/vendors`. All three providers reuse `GenericAvatar` configuration, validation, token handling, and the `generic` wire vendor. The avatar guide includes examples, with public API and serialization tests covering the aliases."
      },
      "releases": [
        {
          "tag": "v2.12.0",
          "published_at": "2026-10-08T22:30:26Z",
          "url": "https://github.com/AgoraIO/agora-agents-go/releases/tag/v2.12.0",
          "notes": "### Added\n\n- **Tavus, Protoface, and LemonSlice avatar aliases** — AgentKit now exports `Tavus`, `Protoface`, `TavusOptions`, `ProtofaceOptions`, `NewTavus`, `NewProtoface`, `LemonSlice`, `LemonSliceOptions`, and `NewLemonSlice` from `agentkit/vendors`. All three providers reuse `GenericAvatar` configuration, validation, token handling, and the `generic` wire vendor. The avatar guide includes examples, with public API and serialization tests covering the aliases."
        },
        {
          "tag": "v2.11.0",
          "published_at": "2026-09-23T16:11:37Z",
          "url": "https://github.com/AgoraIO/agora-agents-go/releases/tag/v2.11.0",
          "notes": "### Added\n\n- **Gemini TTS preview** — Added the Agent Kit Gemini TTS provider with the `gemini-3.8-flash-tts` model, default `Puck` voice, and optional natural-language `style`. Credentials serialize inside `tts.params`.\n- **Session-scoped TTS routing** — Gemini TTS selects the preview endpoint with `agora-feature: gemini-live` for the full session lifecycle, including raw TTS configs, without changing the shared client's production route. Gemini ASR, Gemini Live, and OpenAI GPT Live retain their production routing."
        },
        {
          "tag": "v2.10.0",
          "published_at": "2026-09-18T07:56:51Z",
          "url": "https://github.com/AgoraIO/agora-agents-go/releases/tag/v2.10.0",
          "notes": "### Added\n\n- **Smallest AI providers** — Added `NewSmallestAISTT` and `NewSmallestAITTS` with typed provider options, passthrough parameters, and request-shape coverage.\n- **Typed MLLM tools and MCP servers** — AgentKit MLLM vendors now expose typed inline REST `Tools` and `McpServers` at the top-level `mllm` fields. Qwen Omni and mainland-China LLM vendors support the same options, while the existing map-based GPT Live MCP option remains compatible.\n\n### Changed\n\n- **Gemini Live routing** — All Gemini Live model IDs now use the regional production gateway without a preview feature header and send `greeting_message`. The exported `GeminiLivePreviewURL` and `PreviewFeatureGeminiLive` symbols remain available only for source compatibility and no longer opt requests into preview routing.\n- **OpenAI GPT Live routing** — `NewOpenAIGPTLive` now uses the production regional gateway and no longer sends the preview `agora-feature: live-models` gate. Its typed REST tool and MCP configuration options are documented alongside the production contract.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- **Configuration cloning** — `CloneValue` preserves nil slices as nil, keeps empty slices serializable as `[]`, and copies string/int slices without aliasing the source configuration."
        }
      ]
